+## Subtopics
+
+### Precomputed Normal Shading with Lambertian Lookup
+An optimization where 8-bit anatomy voxel values are stored alongside 13-bit precomputed normals [S4, unofficial]. A shading table is computed at the start of every frame to encode the Lambertian coefficient for the given light direction(s) as a function of the surface normal, enabling efficient lookup-based voxel shading [S4, unofficial].
 
